<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 86.58 to 6746.90.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 4.60 to 408.74.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.48.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1613 to 908.</p>
<p>Volume was 577,777,210 compared with 491,841,370 on Tuesday.</p>
